                    <div class="space-y-2 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 bg-slate-50 p-5 shadow-xs transition hover:shadow-md">
                        <span class="block font-mono text-xs font-bold text-purple-700">TUẦN 3 (Ngày 15 - 21)</span>
